1
00:05:56,000 --> 00:06:02,000
Midnight Son is a drama, horror, action film directed by Scott Leberecht.

2
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:58,000
MIDNIGHT SON is the story of Jacob, a young man confined to a life of isolation, due to
a rare skin disorder that prevents him from being exposed to sunlight.

3
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:54,000
His world opens up when he meets Mary, a local bartender, and falls in love.

4
00:23:44,000 --> 00:23:50,000
Tragically, Jacob’s actions become increasingly bizarre as he struggles
to cope with the effects of his worsening condition.

5
00:29:40,000 --> 00:29:46,000
Forced by the disease to drink human blood for sustenance, he must control his increasingly violent tendencies
as local law enforcement narrow their focus on him as a suspect in a series of grisly murders.

6
00:35:36,000 --> 00:35:42,000
Janitor, played by Tracey Walter.

7
00:41:32,000 --> 00:41:38,000
Russell, played by Arlen Escarpeta.

8
00:47:28,000 --> 00:47:34,000
Detective Ginslegh, played by Larry Cedar.

9
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:30,000
Bar Patron (uncredited), played by Shawn-Caulin Young.

10
00:59:20,000 --> 00:59:26,000
Jacob, played by Zak Kilberg.

11
01:05:16,000 --> 01:05:22,000
Mary, played by Maya Parish.

12
01:11:12,000 --> 01:11:18,000
Midnight Son is a 2011 vampire horror film written and directed by Scott
Leberecht, produced by Matt Compton, and starring Zak Kilberg.

13
01:17:08,000 --> 01:17:14,000
A trailer was released late October 2010.

14
01:23:04,000 --> 01:23:10,000
The tone is dark and emotional.
